OL,3,GNEWSAValve failure on CalMac ferry saw
OL,4,Auncontrolled escape of flammable gas
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the risk of explosion is believed
OL,7,Fto have been low, CalMac described it
OL,8,Fas a "critical failure" in the gas fuel
OL,9,Fsystem and said lessons had been
OL,10,Flearned.
